<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλειφαρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείφω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unguent, anointing-oil, oil,
				fat</i>, used in funeral sacrifices, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.170
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.408
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλειφαρ ἀπὸ κέδρου, ἀπὸ
				σιλλικυπρίων</span>, <i>oil</i> of cedar, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.87
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				94
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ῥόδινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.74
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pitch</i> or <i>resin</i>, to seal wine-jars, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.147
			</span></i>.—Cf. foreg.</div>
